  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual Media Convention 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The convention seeks to provide a platform for students of journalism and communication to share experiences, insights, and innovative practices that harness the power of media, communication, culture and youth participation. It further seeks to promote an understanding of the role of media in cultural preservation, social change and the empowerment of young people as drivers of cultural sustainability and Uganda&#x2019;s transformation.

The planned focus areas of the activity are: 

A. Cultural diversity and heritage preservation 
B. Communication strategies for youth engagement 
C. Media innovation and technological advancements for national transformation 
D. Media literacy and digital citizenship for youth</narrative>
  </description>
